                </view>
                <view class="data-cell">
                    <text class="data-value">1345</text>
                    <view class="data-unit">光照(lx)</view>
                </view>
            </view>
        </view>
    </view>

    <view class="guide-container" wx:if="{{showGuide}}">
        <view class="guide-title">种植建议：</view>
        <view class="guide-item">
            <text class="guide-item-text">温度：当前大棚温度正常。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="guide-item">
            <text class="guide-item-text">湿度：当前大棚湿度正常。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="guide-item">
            <text class="guide-item-text">CO2：当前大棚CO2浓度正常。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="guide-item">
            <text class="guide-item-text">甲醛：当前大棚甲醛含量正常。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="guide-item warning">
            <text class="guide-item-text">土壤：当前大棚两块试验田土壤湿度过高，请打开风机！</text>
        </view>
        <view class="guide-item">
            <text class="guide-item-text">光照：当前大棚光照强度正常。</text>
        </view>
    </view>
</view>